  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7HkqFFq.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"264\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>灌注水晶新增6種不同水晶，以及它們的灌注版本與工具！</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">紅石水晶</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鑽石水晶</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">綠寶石水晶</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鐵水晶</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">煤炭水晶</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">青金石水晶</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/76H49Ug.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"264\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">灌注紅石水晶<br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">灌注鑽石水晶<br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">灌注綠寶石水晶<br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">灌注鐵水晶<br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">灌注煤炭水晶<br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">灌注青金石水晶</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PBtOUCJ.png\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em><strong>所有類型的水晶都有專屬工具！</strong></em></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vXVSuvD.png\" width=\"1022\" height=\"353\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em><strong>當然還有充能器，能將水晶灌注！</strong></em></span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用充能器時，必須將煉獄燃料放入燃料槽，並將欲灌注的水晶放入上方槽位。</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">充能器僅接受<strong><em>煉獄燃料</em></strong>作為燃料。</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>如有問題或建議，歡迎加入 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/uX4Nav8EJH\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>您也可以加入我的 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/staciaexpert\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 來支持這個專案！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>需要伺服器與朋友同樂嗎？</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>點擊<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.bisecthosting.com/stacia\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>或下方圖片！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fstacia\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/78a3b2f0-6ef8-41ac-9cf0-f60c3cb2eb04.png\" width=\"294\" height=\"294\"></strong></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
